 "text": "Hello, how are things going? I use a rear pannier and a front basket. The basket fits under the front brake, so it' really stable. You can use a small basket on the front for groceries, or a front basket and a rear pannier for more stuff. Then a big bag in the front is handy. Keep a small change of clothes and a toiletry kit in case you need to stop early. It' heavy and bulky, and you have to take it on and off every time you board or deboard. Panniers are lighter and stay on your bike the whole ride.",
